* October 23rd - '''Chinggis Warriors''' bench [[ariucle]] and acquire [[tikuak]] from [[The MongolZ Academy]] as his replacement. <ref name="-ariucle +tikuak">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?fbid=122229698480121488|title=Team update|language={{Flag|mn}} Mongolian|author='''Chinggis Warriors'''|date=2025-10-23}}</ref>

