'''FOKUS''' (also known as '''Fokus Clan''') is a [[:Category:Germany|German]] esports organization.

==Timeline==
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2026
|This=1

|content1=
* February 12th - '''FOKUS''' enter ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' with a roster consisting of [[volt]], [[Matheos]], [[Banjo]], [[ztr]] and [[Jorko]], with [[kuben]] and [[kapibe]] joining as the team's coach and assistant coach, respectively. <ref name="FOKUS CS2">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/fokusclancs/status/2021993967047651647|title=On to new beginnings|date=2026-02-12|author='''FOKUS'''}}</ref>
* July 9th - [[Jorko]] is acquired by [[Team Liquid]]. <ref name="-jorko">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/fokusclancs/status/2075249877034897525|title=Today we are saying goodbye to our young prodigy @JorkoTwitch|date=2026-07-09|author='''FOKUS'''}}</ref>
* July 14th - '''FOKUS''' acquire [[podi]] from [[ENCE]]. <ref name="+podi">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/fokusclancs/status/2077030484714889716|title=WELCOME OUR NEW AWP, @PODICSGO|date=2026-07-14|author='''FOKUS'''}}</ref>
* July 16th - '''FOKUS''' acquire [[jocab]] from [[Johnny Speeds]] while [[volt]] is acquired by [[INFINITE]]. <ref name="+jocab">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/fokusclancs/status/2077785382817538293|title=The next addition to FOKUS Counter-Strike|date=2026-07-16|author='''FOKUS'''}}</ref><ref name="-volt">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/fokusclancs/status/2077778018307588210|title=Thanks for everything, @voltcss|date=2026-07-16|author='''FOKUS'''}}</ref>
* September 24th - '''FOKUS''' bench [[kuben]] and sign [[JTR]] as their new coach. <ref name="kuben bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/fokusclancs/status/2103129922558734424|title=Thank you, Jakub!|date=2026-09-24|author='''FOKUS'''}}</ref><ref name="+JTR">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/fokusclancs/status/2103145282318078162|title=Bem-vindo, @JTR_cs!|date=2026-09-24|author='''FOKUS'''}}</ref>
